(2. AI strategy and research assistant architecture) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The company plans a PDF research assistant using retrieval augmented) Tj T*
(generation \(RAG\). Text is extracted from uploaded PDF documents.) Tj T*
(Documents are split into chunks of 1,000 characters with 200-character) Tj T*
(overlap. Local embeddings are stored in a FAISS vector index.) Tj T*
(For each document query, the retriever returns up to four chunks.) Tj T*
(Groq generates answers using the retrieved evidence.) Tj T*
(Serper provides web search for recent information and comparisons.) Tj T*
(The agent can search the PDF, search the web, or use both tools.) Tj T*
(Document answers should cite PDF page numbers.) Tj T*
(Web answers should cite source URLs.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Uploaded PDFs and chat are held in session memory, not durable storage.) Tj T*
(Scanned image-only PDFs require OCR before text retrieval.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Page 2 of 3) Tj T*
ET
